  "liner": {
   "body_md": "## What listeners single out\n\n- **The Other One** (1 review): Opens with an excellent intro into The Other One, which pays off for fans left hanging by the earlier show [2]\n\n## The recordings\n\n- **dac2018-06-06.AKGmix.flac16** (recommended): source not stated; 16 songs; 168 min; rated 5/5 by 1 [1]\n\n## Around the show\n\n- Lightning cut short the BB&T Pavilion show just as the band was about to launch into a strong version of That's It [2]\n- The previous show at BB&T Pavilion ended abruptly because of lightning, just before the band was to play That's It [2]\n\n## Tapers and lineage\n\n- **dac2018-06-06.AKGmix.flac16**: taped by Toaste; transferred by Toaste; source: DFC lawn, stand at about 7 feet > 2x AKG 391 cardioids ORTF and 2x AKG 393 hypercardioids pointed at stacks > Zoom F8 @44.1kHz/16-bit (4-track) > .wav > SDXC [1]\n\n## Art and photos\n\n- Fan art by Live Music Blog: [SETLIST / TWEETS: Dead and Company @ Ruoff Home Mortgage Music Center, Noblesville IN 6.6.18 - Live Music Blog](https://livemusicblog.com/setlist-tweets-dead-and-company-ruoff-home-mortgage-music-center-noblesville-in-6-6-18/) [4]",
